<!doctype lake><title>𝑮𝒆𝒏𝑨𝑰-𝑺𝒂𝒌𝒖𝒓𝒂-𝑰</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="XA3KL" id="XA3KL" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u15779e62" id="u15779e62"> </span><span data-lake-id="ud1e288d0" id="ud1e288d0">🐱</span><span data-lake-id="u9c0a5fa5" id="u9c0a5fa5"> 𝑨𝒖𝒕𝒐-𝑬𝒏𝒄𝒐𝒅𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑽𝒂𝒓𝒊𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏𝒂𝒍 𝑩𝒂𝒚𝒆𝒔</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u97de98be" id="u97de98be"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2a88f577" id="u2a88f577" style="color: #DF2A3F">对于具有连续潜变量或模型参数后验分布不可解析的有向概率模型，如何实现高效的近似推断与参数学习，一直是概率建模领域的重要研究问题</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u4e7436f1" id="u4e7436f1">。针对这一问题，作者提出一种随机变分推断与学习算法。该方法不仅能够有效适用于大规模数据场景，而且在满足若干温和可微条件的前提下，即使面对后验不可解析的情形，仍然具有良好的适用性</span></strong></p><ul list="ub2394d1c"><li fid="ud13828ac" data-lake-id="u250c3f00" id="u250c3f00"><strong><span data-lake-id="u34e13bb9" id="u34e13bb9">变分贝叶斯</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u33c4868a" id="u33c4868a">（Variational Bayesian, VB）方法通常通过优化一个对真实后验的近似分布来处理该问题。然而，传统的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2fb9dfbf" id="u2fb9dfbf">mean-field</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub11d5f6a" id="ub11d5f6a"> 变分方法往往要求能够解析地计算关于近似后验的若干期望，而在一般情形下，这些期望本身同样是不可解析的，从而限制该类方法在复杂模型中的适用性</span></li><li fid="ud13828ac" data-lake-id="u2decf9c0" id="u2decf9c0"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6957fc8" id="ub6957fc8" style="color: #664900">通过对变分下界进行重参数化，可以得到一个简单、可微且无偏的下界估计器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u52cd8dcd" id="u52cd8dcd">。该估计器被称为 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ueaf15c21" id="ueaf15c21">SGVB</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u79ef0226" id="u79ef0226">（Stochastic Gradient Variational Bayes）估计器。SGVB 适用于几乎所有包含连续潜变量和/或参数的模型，能够有效实现近似后验推断，并且可以直接借助标准的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9f56b5fc" id="u9f56b5fc">随机梯度上升</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u23c278a4" id="u23c278a4">方法进行优化</span></li><li fid="ud13828ac" data-lake-id="uaf04d0a8" id="uaf04d0a8"><span data-lake-id="u600be159" id="u600be159">针对由独立同分布样本构成、且每个样本均对应连续潜变量的情形，作者提出 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf6f63a6a" id="uf6f63a6a">Auto-Encoding Variational Bayes（AEVB）算法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8fbca4d2" id="u8fbca4d2">。在该算法中，利用 SGVB 估计器对一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6e61bf30" id="u6e61bf30">识别模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud93b3281" id="ud93b3281">进行优化，从而使推断与学习过程变得尤为高效。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u82543fe6" id="u82543fe6" style="color: #664900">具体而言，该识别模型能够通过简单的祖先采样高效地完成近似后验推断，并进一步促进模型参数的有效学习，而无需针对每一个数据点都采用诸如 MCMC 等代价高昂的迭代式推断过程</span></strong></li><li fid="ud13828ac" data-lake-id="u11d769d1" id="u11d769d1"><span data-lake-id="ude2852bd" id="ude2852bd">学习得到的近似后验推断模型不仅可用于模型训练本身，还能够服务于多种下游任务，例如</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uab7df0ac" id="uab7df0ac">识别、去噪、表示学习以及可视化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u97d58428" id="u97d58428">等。当识别模型由神经网络参数化时，便得到论文所称的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf5a9c80b" id="uf5a9c80b">变分自编码器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u448a1f36" id="u448a1f36">（Variational Auto-Encoder, VAE）</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u84562358" id="u84562358"><strong><span data-lake-id="u10764cbc" id="u10764cbc">论文的贡献主要体现在两个方面</span></strong></p><ul list="u00dd6156"><li fid="u10d45ab4" data-lake-id="u33b810b9" id="u33b810b9"><span data-lake-id="u0dda5959" id="u0dda5959">证明对</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5191a8c4" id="u5191a8c4">变分下界</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue409ef91" id="ue409ef91">进行适当的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u18f1a868" id="u18f1a868">重参数化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua25c303e" id="ua25c303e">后，可以构造一个易于处理的下界估计器，并能够借助标准的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3ee052e9" id="u3ee052e9">随机梯度优化方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u98f3c3b4" id="u98f3c3b4">对其进行直接优化</span></li><li fid="u10d45ab4" data-lake-id="u0c343866" id="u0c343866"><span data-lake-id="u7f2d6316" id="u7f2d6316">对于由独立同分布样本构成、且每个数据点均对应连续潜变量的数据集，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8e9bae77" id="u8e9bae77" style="color: #004347">论文表明可以通过拟合一个针对不可解析真实后验的近似推断模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucafc8c79" id="ucafc8c79">（识别模型），显著提升后验推断的效率；该模型的学习同样依赖于 SGVB</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="hOhzS" id="hOhzS" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uc0cb2814" id="uc0cb2814">🐮</span><span data-lake-id="u3f09082f" id="u3f09082f"> 𝑷𝒓𝒐𝒃𝒍𝒆𝒎 𝒔𝒄𝒆𝒏𝒂𝒓𝒊𝒐</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub79470ac" id="ub79470ac"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub5f592f7" id="ub5f592f7">本节所提出的策略可用于为多种含有连续潜变量的有向图模型构造</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u132c3fa9" id="u132c3fa9" style="color: #DF2A3F">下界估计器</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ue13c4103" id="ue13c4103">，即一种随机目标函数</span></strong></p><ul list="u45fb8dc1"><li fid="u1e830e59" data-lake-id="uae68b47f" id="uae68b47f"><span data-lake-id="u73a2bb2c" id="u73a2bb2c">讨论范围限定于一种常见情形：给定一个由</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5a39330e" id="u5a39330e">独立同分布</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6e4b8418" id="u6e4b8418">样本构成的数据集，且每个数据点对应其自身的潜变量；在这一设定下，希望对</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucaa4e003" id="ucaa4e003">全局参数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uaf4183c2" id="uaf4183c2">进行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub711ca47" id="ub711ca47">最大似然估计</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub019564c" id="ub019564c">或</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufd9f6089" id="ufd9f6089">最大后验估计</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub8bc73d6" id="ub8bc73d6">，同时对潜变量执行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc57bbc07" id="uc57bbc07">变分推断</span></strong></li><li fid="u1e830e59" data-lake-id="u5ca99aeb" id="u5ca99aeb"><span data-lake-id="u795aeeb1" id="u795aeeb1">所考虑的有向图模型中，实线表示生成模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(z)p_%5C%5Ctheta(x%5C%5Cmid%20z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3d8f2699827cc2422e3ada1cc5da9ae0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bBAzX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u11d405d4" id="u11d405d4">，虚线表示对不可解析后验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbc90866c47861e442d8136c6345c8ab9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WIcho%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubdd67fd3" id="ubdd67fd3">的变分近似</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Cphi(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7f8e56433c8a70fa83ba41a8dafc0bc2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Oola9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8ad1aeb2" id="u8ad1aeb2">。其中，变分参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ej24y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud1c77077" id="ud1c77077">与生成模型参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22av0c9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b5bf83c" id="u8b5bf83c">在训练过程中进行联合学习</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc9679025" id="uc9679025" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1775628005270-5fbb7d4f-cd83-4484-b178-f3b05e390868.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ube6b4cd5-d379-4244-bf30-68e815b4b36%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud1949a09-9494-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A245%2C%22height%22%3A175%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A9909%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A355%2C%22originHeight%22%3A254%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22x%22%3A179%2C%22y%22%3A217%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A167%2C%22y%22%3A40%2C%22width%22%3A14%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f7f7%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u49920404%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufeeee079" id="ufeeee079"><span data-lake-id="uf6ebcc12" id="uf6ebcc12">1️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u102adcff" id="u102adcff"> 设有数据集</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctextstyle%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%3D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bx%5E%7B(i)%7D%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc81ba85156289ad7f3a75d3dce466e10.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DQrAw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udc3055f1" id="udc3055f1">，其中包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JGpLI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u33464b6c" id="u33464b6c">个关于某一连续或离散变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7Bx%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffb1416b5e103221479447bcad347089b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D2x1I%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uec5dc7f2" id="uec5dc7f2">的独立同分布样本。假设这些数据由某一随机过程生成，而该过程涉及一个未被观测到的连续随机变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7Bz%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5d25750297babe29cc0de2cf30d0ad9d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22khVvG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3a1cd5e3" id="u3a1cd5e3">。具体而言，这一生成过程可分为两个步骤</span></p><ul list="uf0ad76d5"><li fid="u90bbc3fe" data-lake-id="uf8d57023" id="uf8d57023"><span data-lake-id="u1da9233d" id="u1da9233d">其一，从先验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E%5C%5Cast%7D(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5a9ddd811cd0a0f8aa9e4beac3f3e59a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q4jTy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5adf0b9c" id="u5adf0b9c">中生成一个取值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%5E%7B(i)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae5d3e65cee8c50ed29988c14e2b22a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DyQTr%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u90bbc3fe" data-lake-id="u12c0a544" id="u12c0a544"><span data-lake-id="ud97656a4" id="ud97656a4">其二，再由条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E%5C%5Cast%7D(x%5C%5Cmid%20z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd28bc4fa331041cd9d26bb096191bd07.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XzoHP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8330369e" id="u8330369e">生成一个观测值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%5E%7B(i)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F39a4ba3b6404768070ed4a797f1495b3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DdMJ5%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uff7263e8" id="uff7263e8"><span data-lake-id="u36a176e2" id="u36a176e2">进一步假设，先验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E%5C%5Cast%7D(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5a9ddd811cd0a0f8aa9e4beac3f3e59a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YVwft%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udeabe8db" id="udeabe8db">与似然分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E%5C%5Cast%7D(x%5C%5Cmid%20z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd28bc4fa331041cd9d26bb096191bd07.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a2RKA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ddcd797" id="u0ddcd797">分别来源于参数化分布族</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c8605995b654c966435121ecc385f6b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VGncA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5ef4c2cd" id="u5ef4c2cd">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%5C%5Cmid%20z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8cdba412dcac5755bdfaedb2c9d5e432.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O4nLE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2e6432d2" id="u2e6432d2">，并且它们的概率密度函数关于参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f8f02fd1006c7ebfd3af79fe298d78e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FKSih%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud745b999" id="ud745b999">以及潜变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SmuzJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4325d2af" id="u4325d2af">几乎处处可微。但是生成过程中的大量关键信息是不可见的：真实参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E%5C%5Cast%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf110a9479f6f70db017cebc3eb9dd83.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jGXdm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73e78260" id="u73e78260">以及各潜变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%5E%7B(i)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae5d3e65cee8c50ed29988c14e2b22a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zunsn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u080529ea" id="u080529ea">的具体取值都是未知的</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4674ff72" id="u4674ff72"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8655758f" id="u8655758f">​</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u838e5844" id="u838e5844">2️⃣</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue7858f7e" id="ue7858f7e"> 论文并未对边缘分布或后验分布作出常见的简化性假设。相反，关注一种更一般性的算法框架，即使在如下情形下也能够保持高效性</span></strong></p><ul list="u4c0668b7"><li fid="u08df870d" data-lake-id="uea309752" id="uea309752"><strong><span data-lake-id="u89845fa1" id="u89845fa1">不可解析性</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud8f63ddc" id="ud8f63ddc">。当边缘似然</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x)%3D%5C%5Cint%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z)%5C%5C%2Cp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%5C%5Cmid%20z)%5C%5C%2Cdz%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdce6677712f7764c94985844b665f584.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DgCVu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u767a8f9d" id="u767a8f9d">对应的积分不可解析时，既无法直接计算边缘似然，也无法对其求导；同时，真实后验密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%5C%5Cmid%20z)%5C%5C%2Cp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z)%7D%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcc8cd6758cd86d5b8a10ca980038b149.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HuPBX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4b1a13ff" id="u4b1a13ff">同样不可解析，从而传统的 EM 算法也无法使用；进一步地，即便采用任意合理的 mean-field 变分贝叶斯方法，其所需的积分在一般情况下也可能仍然不可解析</span></li><li fid="u08df870d" data-lake-id="u7d98dfe5" id="u7d98dfe5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9e0fa3da" id="u9e0fa3da">大规模数据集</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua208276d" id="ua208276d">。即数据量极其庞大，以至于批量优化的代价过高；因此，希望能够仅利用较小的 mini-batch，甚至单个样本，就完成参数更新。基于采样的方法，例如 Monte Carlo EM，在这种情况下通常过于缓慢，因为它往往要求对每个数据点都执行一次代价不菲的采样循环</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3c01e521" id="u3c01e521"><span data-lake-id="ub5ab1ab4" id="ub5ab1ab4">3️⃣</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6bcf294a" id="u6bcf294a"> 在上述设定下，论文关注并试图解决以下三个相互关联的问题</span></strong></p><ul list="u1ec7d527"><li fid="ubdf3b449" data-lake-id="uc0f163ac" id="uc0f163ac"><span data-lake-id="ucde7a80a" id="ucde7a80a">如何对参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22caLHR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue8ba0524" id="ue8ba0524">进行高效的近似最大似然估计（ML）或最大后验估计（MAP）</span></li><li fid="ubdf3b449" data-lake-id="uc553a209" id="uc553a209"><span data-lake-id="ufccd879c" id="ufccd879c">如何在给定参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uU2xo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue0ab6ff2" id="ue0ab6ff2">的情况下，对观测值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k9iUm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua8683f83" id="ua8683f83">所对应的潜变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22W8JtC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2cb879d0" id="u2cb879d0">进行高效的近似后验推断</span></li><li fid="ubdf3b449" data-lake-id="u0de74f9a" id="u0de74f9a"><span data-lake-id="u7bb1993b" id="u7bb1993b">如何对变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P3cmK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u132e4a18" id="u132e4a18">的边缘分布进行高效的近似推断。这使得我们能够开展各类需要</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22njnrN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64e29c56" id="u64e29c56">的先验分布作为支撑的推断任务</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua8f0e6a4" id="ua8f0e6a4"><span data-lake-id="u8d115863" id="u8d115863">4️⃣</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf677e48e" id="uf677e48e" style="color: #70000D"> 为解决上述问题，作者进一步引入一个识别模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F44ade8099e05170d147b4529ea9a84e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lQqSU%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u772d6519" id="u772d6519" style="color: #70000D">将其作为对不可解析真实后验</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F160d6d2c4a69b27e596c74fe55ae82f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ibfxK%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uebd45f0a" id="uebd45f0a" style="color: #70000D">的近似。与 mean-field 变分推断中的近似后验不同，这里的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d09d895a9d83061cdf547c013dad245.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jgfH2%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u349f9a82" id="u349f9a82" style="color: #70000D">并不要求具有因子化结构，其参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TYx7t%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud019939f" id="ud019939f" style="color: #70000D">也并非通过某种闭式期望计算获得。相反，论文提出一种方法用以将识别模型参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V79fU%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud0b0a437" id="ud0b0a437" style="color: #70000D">与生成模型参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NqRvu%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u75b2fd16" id="u75b2fd16" style="color: #70000D">进行联合学习</span></strong></p><ul list="u88466c8d"><li fid="ua912db26" data-lake-id="ua4e18b9d" id="ua4e18b9d"><span data-lake-id="u53e664bb" id="u53e664bb">从编码理论的视角来看，未观测变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vv4lp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uab8ca014" id="uab8ca014">可以被解释为一种潜在表示或潜在编码。也将识别模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d09d895a9d83061cdf547c013dad245.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uObxM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u82488a80" id="u82488a80">称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u19e884ea" id="u19e884ea">概率编码器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u265c115f" id="u265c115f">：给定一个数据点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22svJEV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u10cc5c46" id="u10cc5c46">，它输出一个关于潜在编码</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rSk1K%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u661d0849" id="u661d0849">可能取值的概率分布（例如高斯分布），这些潜在编码都可能是生成该数据点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G7NHr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7995eba7" id="u7995eba7">的潜在原因</span></li><li fid="ua912db26" data-lake-id="u4115f3ac" id="u4115f3ac"><span data-lake-id="ubc500849" id="ubc500849">将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%5C%5Cmid%20z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8cdba412dcac5755bdfaedb2c9d5e432.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O0BXt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u88fa2a3c" id="u88fa2a3c">称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4fd54184" id="u4fd54184">概率解码器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6cb0f2ee" id="u6cb0f2ee">，因为在给定某个潜在编码</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aBT1j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uffd833d6" id="uffd833d6">的条件下，它给出对应的观测变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JYKva%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf309cb73" id="uf309cb73">的可能取值分布</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="NxQHu" id="NxQHu" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ueb19a092" id="ueb19a092">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u2967a3a7" id="u2967a3a7"> 𝑻𝒉𝒆 𝑽𝒂𝒓𝒊𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏𝒂𝒍 𝑩𝒐𝒖𝒏𝒅</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub08975d8" id="ub08975d8"><span data-lake-id="ud13d1c24" id="ud13d1c24">边缘似然可以分解为各个数据点边缘似然对数的求和，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(x%5E%7B(1)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ccdots%2C%20x%5E%7B(N)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(x%5E%7B(i)%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94c8105a29d7541105bb35eeddf8d0c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ni3oY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u886fb001" id="u886fb001">而对于每一个数据点，其边缘似然又可进一步改写为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8ce2691d" id="u8ce2691d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(x%5E%7B(i)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%20%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2C%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D%5C%5Cright).%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22712fb0d445553ff2f89ca5c71108be.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EkSAT%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u46964823" id="u46964823"><span data-lake-id="uaf1c03bf" id="uaf1c03bf">式中，右侧第一项表示近似后验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd966b4dd339c6a2d76437164788b3c95.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Vtz4c%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb6efa40" id="ucb6efa40">相对于真实后验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7ea290845c38449a6ba6b6d69616b85b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wkz4O%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc5eb1c15" id="uc5eb1c15">的 Kullback–Leibler 散度。由于该 KL 散度恒为非负，因此右侧第二项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3309fc6558c429b4fdfe0cb26f09f128.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C3X5z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua3fde3fb" id="ua3fde3fb">被称为第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PCRpo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u902f326c" id="u902f326c">个数据点边缘似然的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u41e7f810" id="u41e7f810">变分下界</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub2b0eb77" id="ub2b0eb77">。其具体形式可写为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8ba1cf95" id="u8ba1cf95" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x)%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x)%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B6pt%5D%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Clog%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%2Cz)%7D%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z%7Cx)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B6pt%5D%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Clog%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%2Cz)q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z%7Cx)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B6pt%5D%5Cn%26%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Clog%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%2Cz)%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%7D_%7B%5C%5Csubstack%7B%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%7D(x)%5C%5C%5C%5C(%5C%5Cmathrm%7BELBO%7D)%7D%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Clog%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z%7Cx)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%7D_%7B%3DD_%7BKL%7D(q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%5C%5C%7Cp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z%7Cx))%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F04ce375f80c28a2dc00134a1d6173742.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oaVWg%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u461cc99e" id="u461cc99e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(x%5E%7B(i)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cge%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%7D%20%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B%20-%5C%5Clog%20q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%20%2B%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%5E%7B(i)%7D%2C%20z)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3cb9bc5a80264b3b6255a1f0f7f0dc7b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TI3GB%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u69699a5a" id="u69699a5a"><span data-lake-id="ueeb80ece" id="ueeb80ece">该变分下界还可以等价地表示为</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc97b3d6b" id="uc97b3d6b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20-%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7BD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%20%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2C%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z)%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BRegularization%20(KL%20Divergence)%7D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%7D%20%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%5E%7B(i)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20z)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BReconstruction%20Likelihood%7D%7D%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9da92cccb2bcdac63f3c522f8af57862.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HnSCy%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub43ccd36" id="ub43ccd36"><span data-lake-id="u6ebd41e3" id="u6ebd41e3">目标是对变分下界</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3309fc6558c429b4fdfe0cb26f09f128.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ebP79%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf17e98bb" id="uf17e98bb">分别关于变分参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OtUgX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb007bf9" id="ucb007bf9">与生成模型参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lkfhB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue1008a0a" id="ue1008a0a">求导并进行优化。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4739df94" id="u4739df94" style="color: #2A4200">然而，相较于关于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GjXAG%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u237ec058" id="u237ec058" style="color: #2A4200">的优化，关于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rfdD1%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u70501ad3" id="u70501ad3" style="color: #2A4200">的梯度计算则稍显棘手</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0c355c59" id="u0c355c59">。对于此类问题，通常使用的朴素 Monte Carlo 梯度估计器为</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud1ef54db" id="ud1ef54db" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z)%7D%5Bf(z)%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z)%7D%20%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B%20f(z)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D%5C%5Clog%20q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BL%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bl%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%20f%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(z%5E%7B(l)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D%5C%5Clog%20q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(z%5E%7B(l)%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7336f8898b5bda66d64201247de87b4d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JC8Ct%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7657eb29" id="u7657eb29"><span data-lake-id="uf9e779d5" id="uf9e779d5">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%5E%7B(l)%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F74ec1cd05ecfb51fd5ec823081dbde32.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wKTkU%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u688cdeb3" id="u688cdeb3" style="color: #DF2A3F">然而，这种梯度估计器通常具有较高的方差，因此在论文关注的问题设定下并不实用</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="GtNhJ" id="GtNhJ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u7f9c016a" id="u7f9c016a">🐻</span><span data-lake-id="u501f8ac7" id="u501f8ac7"> 𝑻𝒉𝒆 𝑺𝑮𝑽𝑩 𝑬𝒔𝒕𝒊𝒎𝒂𝒕𝒐𝒓 𝒂𝒏𝒅 𝑨𝑬𝑽𝑩 𝑨𝒍𝒈𝒐𝒓𝒊𝒕𝒉𝒎</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u3f273025" id="u3f273025"><span data-lake-id="uff0ee775" id="uff0ee775">在若干温和条件下，对于选定的近似后验</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d09d895a9d83061cdf547c013dad245.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EYdZw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2961bd71" id="u2961bd71">，可以借助辅助噪声变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FJQVF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4774e2a2" id="u4774e2a2">及其可微变换</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcbfe1c2018eb15911adedc76b7ed5a4d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ffRcQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue5508bd4" id="ue5508bd4">对随机变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%5C%5Csim%20q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F358961a44f392d47b2980337317c69d8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g9LEu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6f27216d" id="u6f27216d">进行重参数化，即写为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1da20d46" id="u1da20d46" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%20%3D%20g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%20x)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20p(%5C%5Cepsilon).%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4cfd5b21ad7d185cfa5ee1e4161eeafb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jruhs%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub3b49ab5" id="ub3b49ab5"><span data-lake-id="u3f5974f0" id="u3f5974f0">基于上述重参数化形式，可以对关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d09d895a9d83061cdf547c013dad245.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c2UoT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc5bb3d81" id="uc5bb3d81">的某一函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F98d994c276bf0464fffd664d200efcb4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TfnpW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u18ce53e4" id="u18ce53e4">的期望构造如下 Monte Carlo 估计：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4538d749" id="u4538d749" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(i)%7D)%7D%20%5Bf(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20f(g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(i)%7D))%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Csimeq%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BL%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bl%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%20f(g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5E%7B(l)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(i)%7D))%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5E%7B(l)%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20p(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbbf1c753a7df94d9190a32b8eb2a9685.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gWWg0%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uaf6fa556" id="uaf6fa556"><span data-lake-id="ufa58d2c1" id="ufa58d2c1">将这一技术应用于变分下界，从而得到一般形式的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u744980c6" id="u744980c6">随机梯度变分贝叶斯</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u158cef23" id="u158cef23">（SGVB）估计器</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5E%7BA%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b344d1e9542c4899e1b25f81f28c799.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DQnNs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc4c18cf2" id="uc4c18cf2">其表达式为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7532528b" id="u7532528b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5E%7BA%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BL%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bl%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(x%5E%7B(i)%7D%2C%20z%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(z%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F424bf93df6f9dc960825b356aab5ae1a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ygj2j%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufebfae49" id="ufebfae49" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D%20%3D%20g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(i)%7D)%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Band%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5E%7B(l)%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20p(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5bb34303f98df7b51fab9019168164b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rbJMt%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u89169ae1" id="u89169ae1"><span data-lake-id="u947ac2eb" id="u947ac2eb">在许多情况下，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%20%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2C%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z)%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F13d51d9a0c66bac30abc52592536b044.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P4lqE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue77f62fc" id="ue77f62fc">可以被解析积分求得，仅需对期望重构项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%5E%7B(i)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20z)%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc34caa2c4e7fa60caa7cc5828fde6f18.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MZyws%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb1a6544" id="udb1a6544">进行采样估计。此时，KL 散度项可以被解释为对参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CMpq0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uce507043" id="uce507043">的一种正则化，它鼓励近似后验分布靠近先验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c8605995b654c966435121ecc385f6b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wetes%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1b1d7432" id="u1b1d7432">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3866b1c2" id="u3866b1c2">基于此，可得到 SGVB 估计器的第二种形式</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5E%7BB%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa2f57fd4ba111c83b55300f1a6411a86.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22szwzU%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3a3123f8" id="u3a3123f8">，并且通常相比一般形式的估计器具有更低的方差</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u38b9e57a" id="u38b9e57a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5E%7BB%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%20%3D%20-%20D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%20%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2C%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z)%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BL%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bl%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(x%5E%7B(i)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20z%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6bb98e050ba77da650be366a749bc36c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FS6AD%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ubc890d18" id="ubc890d18" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D%20%3D%20g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(i)%7D)%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Band%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5E%7B(l)%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20p(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5bb34303f98df7b51fab9019168164b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Oap9U%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u72280710" id="u72280710"><span data-lake-id="u49f56959" id="u49f56959">对于包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Tj7Ye%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4451c70e" id="u4451c70e">个样本的数据集</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe759754bedb66013be5a4832b786a067.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EdzpS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6e4969ab" id="u6e4969ab">还可以基于 mini-batch 构造整个数据集边缘似然下界的估计器，即</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0fe0f407" id="u0fe0f407" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D)%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5E%7BM%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%5E%7BM%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BN%7D%7BM%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BM%7D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%2C%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe189e8f86fc67ea891fd0f41712957bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fNMet%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ube26a989" id="ube26a989"><span data-lake-id="u2ea8e27c" id="u2ea8e27c">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%5E%7BM%7D%3D%5C%5C%7Bx%5E%7B(i)%7D%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BM%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F96b237e71db9901c26792b109259fa1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YG56U%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue94b4f2e" id="ue94b4f2e">是从包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22F1VNV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1179a25a" id="u1179a25a">个样本的完整数据集</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18c08d4023d6d8076d054c47b4895d84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w03X2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u787fa7c8" id="u787fa7c8">中随机抽取的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J7Ucy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud455f7a6" id="ud455f7a6">个样本。在本文实验中，作者发现当 mini-batch 的规模</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mccz0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufa1da1e1" id="ufa1da1e1">足够大时，例如</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%3D100%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fec17a79f6cab869fb5f835fd333dad51.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WdBmK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2b2bd069" id="u2b2bd069">，每个数据点只取一个采样点，即令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe824740875fe93bdc428279f2d00e2a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YoBPG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u465e466e" id="u465e466e">，通常便已足够。此时，可以进一步对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%5E%7BM%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F436baf12490ec7d6ba1b6deb1e3aa407.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oWs8X%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u387335f3" id="u387335f3">关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CLZ83%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u30946753" id="u30946753">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VVJev%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5345011b" id="u5345011b">求梯度，并将所得梯度与 SGD、Adagrad 等随机优化方法结合使用</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5b916af3" id="u5b916af3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1775658213686-9b912d04-5cb5-4bec-88b2-dc1c48237657.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u96ef0741-682d-45c8-8fb9-03413101373%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u28d95aaf-5bdb-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A715.1818237304688%2C%22height%22%3A229%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A96288%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1092%2C%22originHeight%22%3A349%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%220.O-UPDATEPARAMETERSUSINGGRADIENTSG(E.G.SGDORADAGRAD%7CDHSL0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A71%2C%22y%22%3A243%2C%22width%22%3A854%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X-RANDOMMINIBATCHOF%2FDATAPOINTS(DRAWNFROMFULLDATASET%22%2C%22x%22%3A69%2C%22y%22%3A150%2C%22width%22%3A760%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GVBESTIMATORSINSECTION2.3CANBEUSED.WEUSESETTINGSM%3DI(0ANDL%3DIIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A52%2C%22width%22%3A903%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LGORITHMIMINIBATCHVERSIONOFTHEAUTO-ENCODINGVB(AEVB)ALGONTHM.EITH%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A919%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G-VEC(0.O%3AXE)(GRADIENTSOFMINIBATCHESTIMATOR(8))%22%2C%22x%22%3A76%2C%22y%22%3A213%2C%22width%22%3A727%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E-RANDOMSAMPLESFROMNOISEDISTRIBUTONP(E)%22%2C%22x%22%3A72%2C%22y%22%3A182%2C%22width%22%3A560%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UNTILCONVERGENCEOFPARAMETERS(0%2CP)%22%2C%22x%22%3A41%2C%22y%22%3A274%2C%22width%22%3A449%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%2CO-LNITIALIZEPARAMETERS%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A320%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RETURNB%2CP%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A306%2C%22width%22%3A162%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALGORITHM.EITHEROFTHETWO%22%2C%22x%22%3A763%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A318%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2200ANDL%3D1INEXPERIMENTS.%22%2C%22x%22%3A745%2C%22y%22%3A53%2C%22width%22%3A328%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REPEAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eaeaea%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u9fe65f2f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u43acc958" id="u43acc958"><span data-lake-id="u4256bcea" id="u4256bcea">从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5E%7BB%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cphi%3B%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F29513b463f66049a1cfc4a838e5e8ddf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fvmIz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7724a2a1" id="u7724a2a1">目标函数形式可以更加清晰地看出它与</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u23d80540" id="u23d80540">自编码器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uade33018" id="uade33018">之间的联系。第一项，即近似后验相对于先验分布的 KL 散度，可被视为一种正则项；第二项则可以理解为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0946b367" id="u0946b367">期望意义下的负重构误差</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub356386f" id="ub356386f">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua07e4dcb" id="ua07e4dcb" style="color: #664900">函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F84809662294ac0758216989b6bdf59ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w5G6v%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7d688e2a" id="u7d688e2a" style="color: #664900">被设计为将数据点</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%5E%7B(i)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F39a4ba3b6404768070ed4a797f1495b3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e9pR1%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u38e8af13" id="u38e8af13" style="color: #664900">与随机噪声向量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%5E%7B(l)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34066c884b0312b6697e0ff38a780da9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SMazW%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9005ec43" id="u9005ec43" style="color: #664900">映射为该数据点近似后验分布中的一个样本</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u77ea1aad" id="u77ea1aad">，即</span></p><p data-lake-id="u248168a4" id="u248168a4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D%20%3D%20g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon%5E%7B(l)%7D%2C%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20z%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc8182dbf5699d5528c5dff60512eeac3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HJgRH%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u94da16cb" id="u94da16cb"><span data-lake-id="u5ee0c706" id="u5ee0c706">随后，该样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7e994cc799d7ce4e37fa8a49a0d42184.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UrT3k%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc865a447" id="uc865a447">被输入到函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%5E%7B(i)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20z%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6624472f65b43819b88c0b468c4a6d23.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ffVi0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufff35734" id="ufff35734">该项表示在给定潜变量样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7e994cc799d7ce4e37fa8a49a0d42184.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PDS07%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u35b043f2" id="u35b043f2">的条件下，观测数据点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%5E%7B(i)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F39a4ba3b6404768070ed4a797f1495b3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sep5K%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufcef10ef" id="ufcef10ef">在生成模型下的概率密度（或概率质量）。按照自编码器的术语，它可以被视为一种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u809a9d72" id="u809a9d72">负重构误差</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="UWid2" id="UWid2" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub4e0caed" id="ub4e0caed">🫎</span><span data-lake-id="u956b8c00" id="u956b8c00">  𝑻𝒉𝒆 𝑹𝒆𝒑𝒂𝒓𝒂𝒎𝒆𝒕𝒆𝒓𝒊𝒛𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝑻𝒓𝒊𝒄𝒌</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u32c092f8" id="u32c092f8"><span data-lake-id="u1e078fa4" id="u1e078fa4">1️⃣</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u501cedfa" id="u501cedfa"> 为解决上述问题，采用一种从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d09d895a9d83061cdf547c013dad245.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PGBKO%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub5338daa" id="ub5338daa">中生成样本的替代方法。其核心的重参数化技巧实际上相当直接。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uab0b6921" id="uab0b6921">设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g3st3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6e044c12" id="u6e044c12">为一个连续随机变量，并且满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%20%5C%5Csim%20q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb71004a4fd52667d158dc1ee7ab9056d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uwehO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubaa5da3b" id="ubaa5da3b">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d09d895a9d83061cdf547c013dad245.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w32Bm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uad1958a2" id="uad1958a2">为某一条件分布。在许多情况下，可以将随机变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cBJp4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uce9b1a2f" id="uce9b1a2f">表示为一个确定性变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%20%3D%20g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%20x).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F853106e9dba238898629e78c62b5fb31.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gfXTV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3fe4d8ea" id="u3fe4d8ea">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JO3Tv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4867624" id="ud4867624">是一个辅助随机变量，服从与模型参数无关的边缘分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20p(%5C%5Cepsilon)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F766aa1ba0477874ad91e5935c11042aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vVVgJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u06171cb1" id="u06171cb1">而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F84809662294ac0758216989b6bdf59ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FQjFp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1bed7d93" id="u1bed7d93">则是一个由参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n5mIO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8e32c2ab" id="u8e32c2ab">控制的向量值函数。这种重参数化能够将关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d09d895a9d83061cdf547c013dad245.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22asd4R%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8669a9ec" id="u8669a9ec">的期望改写为另一种形式，使得对应的 Monte Carlo 估计关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JGp7v%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d8dce21" id="u7d8dce21">是可微的</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1f6c01ec" id="u1f6c01ec"><span data-lake-id="uf10860e4" id="uf10860e4">2️⃣</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8f857a75" id="u8f857a75"> 给定确定性映射</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%20%3D%20g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%20x)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f418cc1baa639ccb28ccf13d26d0554.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qb20p%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u92fa89cf" id="u92fa89cf">知道</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Clvert%20dz_i%20%5C%5Crvert%20%3D%20p(%5C%5Cepsilon)%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Clvert%20d%5C%5Cepsilon_i%20%5C%5Crvert%20.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F78416c8de27ec0302cea3bb86a10a760.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZCaWz%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="udfba4d36" id="udfba4d36">因此有</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uf3ce851c" id="uf3ce851c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cint%20q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5C%5C%2C%20f(z)%5C%5C%2C%20dz%20%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20p(%5C%5Cepsilon)%5C%5C%2C%20f(z)%5C%5C%2C%20d%5C%5Cepsilon%20%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20p(%5C%5Cepsilon)%5C%5C%2C%20f%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbigl(g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%20x)%5C%5Cbigr)%5C%5C%2C%20d%5C%5Cepsilon.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79398c71869247ece9bc2a9e62d99f7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hjsiS%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5924cda0" id="u5924cda0"><span data-lake-id="u293ce1fb" id="u293ce1fb">由此可知，可以构造如下可微估计器：</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf99f2409" id="uf99f2409" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cint%20q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5C%5C%2C%20f(z)%5C%5C%2C%20dz%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BL%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bl%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%20f%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbigl(g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(x%2C%5C%5Cepsilon%5E%7B(l)%7D)%5C%5Cbigr)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cepsilon%5E%7B(l)%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20p(%5C%5Cepsilon).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79e4cc76b9fff9d03169ecfaa94bece5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cLeZW%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ucb22a966" id="ucb22a966"><span data-lake-id="u05fff558" id="u05fff558">3️⃣</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubc708e75" id="ubc708e75" style="color: #70000D"> 重参数化公式本质上是一个对期望项进行可微 Monte Carlo 估计的通用工具，其具体作用取决于被积函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F98d994c276bf0464fffd664d200efcb4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wjkXj%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uebbee1a3" id="uebbee1a3" style="color: #70000D">的选取</span></strong></p><ul list="u206bddee"><li fid="u72a23284" data-lake-id="uc7c6f301" id="uc7c6f301"><span data-lake-id="u262afea1" id="u262afea1">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5C%5C%7Cp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F30450b95fda8c4ec593d7d53fc9f04eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rR20T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4da45c79" id="u4da45c79">无解析解时，可令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(z)%3D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%2Cz)-%5C%5Clog%20q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc72fbbd4b548f94218e0b66961c47e6b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KMrx2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubdbcda3b" id="ubdbcda3b">从而对整个 ELBO 进行采样估计，得到一般形式的 SGVB 目标</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5E%7BA%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F755ce1f030f80d4f4639fef21ae03608.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X1U6u%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u72a23284" data-lake-id="uf60c0f07" id="uf60c0f07"><span data-lake-id="u6e49cbd5" id="u6e49cbd5">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5C%5C%7Cp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F30450b95fda8c4ec593d7d53fc9f04eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RYY5H%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2f7098d1" id="u2f7098d1">散度具有闭式解，通常将其单独解析计算，对重构对数似然项进行采样估计，令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(z)%3D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%5C%5Cmid%20z)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc1a5f7d5b1f2ef9948b5acef88d36a82.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rjega%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u81ba6ad0" id="u81ba6ad0">从而得到方差更低的目标形式</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5E%7BB%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F99ab2d9e5998a8dfc311155026511b55.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hHtHj%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6d2558e2" id="u6d2558e2"><span data-lake-id="u74969be5" id="u74969be5">4️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="ue890546a" id="ue890546a"> 以一维高斯分布为例。设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%20%5C%5Csim%20p(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmu%2C%5C%5Csigma%5E2).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21ad9b77c2a4906b7261a05d57ea2000.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SfucW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u84a948e4" id="u84a948e4">在这种情况下，一个有效的重参数化方式为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmu%20%2B%20%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbe42a723be8f3a51f691aa43f4c0be68.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rDEaI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7a2a8bae" id="u7a2a8bae">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YP2ua%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u736fb040" id="u736fb040">是辅助噪声变量，并满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C1).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0ec88e70841f717abdcf0c7d13a875ff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RWz13%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucf81c1f2" id="ucf81c1f2">因此</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub82a68d5" id="ub82a68d5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(z%3B%5C%5Cmu%2C%5C%5Csigma%5E2)%7D%5Bf(z)%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon%3B0%2C1)%7D%5Bf(%5C%5Cmu%2B%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cepsilon)%5D%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BL%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bl%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%20f%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmu%2B%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cepsilon%5E%7B(l)%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cepsilon%5E%7B(l)%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C1).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd0160ebbcae631d59a4e1ac64d7a6b08.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X0GjJ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u57e32686" id="u57e32686"><span data-lake-id="ue597fc00" id="ue597fc00">5️⃣</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1974569d" id="u1974569d"> 对于近似后验分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d09d895a9d83061cdf547c013dad245.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wT3EP%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3f57fa7" id="ua3f57fa7">，可根据其分布特性选择相应的重参数化方式；常见策略主要包括逆累积分布函数法、位置—尺度族构造法以及复合变换法</span></strong></p><ul list="ua56f8626"><li fid="u4d582ccb" data-lake-id="u2c98541a" id="u2c98541a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u17721d1f" id="u17721d1f">可求逆累积分布函数：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc55c99f5" id="uc55c99f5">在这种情形下，可令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20U(0%2C%20I)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fba895cf285e64f53099c00c2301c80a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XNIML%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u93febf3a" id="u93febf3a">并将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcbfe1c2018eb15911adedc76b7ed5a4d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c96ry%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb29628c" id="udb29628c">定义为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d09d895a9d83061cdf547c013dad245.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aNbgR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u91416d7c" id="u91416d7c">的逆累积分布函数。适用于该方法的分布包括指数分布、柯西分布、Logistic 分布、Rayleigh 分布、Pareto 分布、Weibull 分布、Reciprocal 分布、Gompertz 分布、Gumbel 分布以及 Erlang 分布等</span></li><li fid="u4d582ccb" data-lake-id="uf885f724" id="uf885f724"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf6f49bfd" id="uf6f49bfd">位置—尺度族分布：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7e11447d" id="u7e11447d">与高斯分布的例子类似，对于任意位置—尺度族分布，都可以将其标准形式（即位置参数为 0、尺度参数为 1 的分布）选作辅助变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TrbIj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf5ccbf76" id="uf5ccbf76">，并令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g(%5C%5Cepsilon)%3D%5C%5Ctext%7Blocation%7D%2B%5C%5Ctext%7Bscale%7D%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cepsilon.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd5279fba9eecbf3ee8def5c8e8b436cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VId7p%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud8254432" id="ud8254432">属于这一类的分布包括 Laplace 分布、椭圆分布、Logistic 分布、均匀分布、三角分布以及高斯分布等</span></li><li fid="u4d582ccb" data-lake-id="u15d32c16" id="u15d32c16"><strong><span data-lake-id="u34c82bea" id="u34c82bea">复合变换：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u70aa2972" id="u70aa2972">在许多情况下，随机变量可以表示为辅助变量经过一系列不同变换后的结果。例如：对数正态分布可以看作正态变量的指数变换；Gamma 分布可以表示为若干指数分布变量之和；Dirichlet 分布可以表示为 Gamma 随机变量的加权归一化和；此外，Beta 分布、卡方分布以及 F 分布等也都可以通过类似方式构造</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="ox4IA" id="ox4IA" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u92ccc48c" id="u92ccc48c">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="ub427e7b2" id="ub427e7b2"> 𝑬𝒙𝒂𝒎𝒑𝒍𝒆: 𝑽𝒂𝒓𝒊𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏𝒂𝒍 𝑨𝒖𝒕𝒐-𝑬𝒏𝒄𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒓</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u008afa05" id="u008afa05"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f2995bf" id="u2f2995bf">采用神经网络来构造概率编码器</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F44ade8099e05170d147b4529ea9a84e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vX2zi%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud4cf5aa8" id="ud4cf5aa8">即生成模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%2Cz)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbc6c534762faced97bed6b095aee9a65.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WqppZ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufff6bd98" id="ufff6bd98">后验分布的近似模型，并利用 AEVB 算法对参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HyAnN%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua9f5a58b" id="ua9f5a58b">与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XEBkg%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6b9accd0" id="u6b9accd0">进行联合优化</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u07e30dd4" id="u07e30dd4"><span data-lake-id="u0997a28c" id="u0997a28c">1️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u0cc7d1d0" id="u0cc7d1d0"> 设潜变量的先验分布为中心化的各向同性多元高斯分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(z%3B0%2CI).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa28a71b84710b294f18df5a140d863dd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BkloP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u71bfc5bd" id="u71bfc5bd">需要注意的是，在这一设定下，先验分布本身不含可学习参数。对于条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%5C%5Cmid%20z)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95e56099a9a8920617324ab0adcca5bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AASgv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7156f389" id="u7156f389">作者假定当数据为实值型时，其服从多元高斯分布；当数据为二值型时，其服从 Bernoulli 分布。对应分布的参数由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cJR4N%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u32385118" id="u32385118">通过一个多层感知机计算得到</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1272608a" id="u1272608a"><span data-lake-id="u8a4f4329" id="u8a4f4329">2️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u02afea05" id="u02afea05"> 在这种设定下，真实后验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F160d6d2c4a69b27e596c74fe55ae82f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hE5tk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue53aa6c5" id="ue53aa6c5">是不可解析的。尽管近似后验</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d09d895a9d83061cdf547c013dad245.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ueypJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9fc4c0a" id="ub9fc4c0a">的形式具有较大的选择自由，作者在此假设真实但不可解析的后验分布可以由一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2fccb721" id="u2fccb721">协方差近似对角化的高斯分布</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u25015a5d" id="u25015a5d">较好近似。在这一情形下，变分近似后验可设为具有对角协方差结构的多元高斯分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbigl(z%3B%5C%5Cmu%5E%7B(i)%7D%2C(%5C%5Csigma%5E%7B(i)%7D)%5E%7B2%7DI%5C%5Cbigr).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb4a40005bd631774bf7ee8d3a1aa7b47.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ufuy7%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0d81226e" id="u0d81226e" style="color: #E4495B">其中，近似后验分布的均值</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu%5E%7B(i)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F155a0fe1bcbc2a1843a51b31553a8b8e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QCfxp%22%7D" style="color: #E4495B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u60c5b9b4" id="u60c5b9b4" style="color: #E4495B">与标准差</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%5E%7B(i)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40f5de6cb7246e113033741b3683c4a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jySlF%22%7D" style="color: #E4495B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u31751d31" id="u31751d31" style="color: #E4495B">由编码端 MLP 输出，即它们是数据点</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%5E%7B(i)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F39a4ba3b6404768070ed4a797f1495b3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VXKTg%22%7D" style="color: #E4495B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubb0059b6" id="ubb0059b6" style="color: #E4495B">以及变分参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Nq1Fl%22%7D" style="color: #E4495B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u977c08db" id="u977c08db" style="color: #E4495B">的非线性函数</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u891b0ddd" id="u891b0ddd"><span data-lake-id="u0bd48752" id="u0bd48752">3️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u570edad3" id="u570edad3"> 通过重参数化方式从后验分布中采样，即令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(i)%7D)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F731ad924fffc1b8112ea6299a7d1741b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WlOqk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8ab12761" id="u8ab12761">并写成</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D%20%3D%20g_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(x%5E%7B(i)%7D%2C%5C%5Cepsilon%5E%7B(l)%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmu%5E%7B(i)%7D%2B%5C%5Csigma%5E%7B(i)%7D%5C%5Codot%20%5C%5Cepsilon%5E%7B(l)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cepsilon%5E%7B(l)%7D%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4406e70378f696b1fff54826f31619d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AiFiw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufefff9c8" id="ufefff9c8">在该模型中，先验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c8605995b654c966435121ecc385f6b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oUvtb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u29a0c10e" id="u29a0c10e">和近似后验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d09d895a9d83061cdf547c013dad245.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r5hxC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud123a595" id="ud123a595">均为高斯分布，因此可以采用 SGVB 估计器。此时，KL 散度项可以直接解析计算并求导，而无需再通过采样进行估计。解码项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%5E%7B(i)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20z%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feea5a109262160308d43554bcfb235ce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u3aJo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0c1f1c3f" id="u0c1f1c3f">具体由 Bernoulli 型或 Gaussian 型的 MLP 给出，其形式取决于所建模数据的类型</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4707c5bd" id="u4707c5bd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cphi%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(i)%7D)%20%26%5C%5Csimeq%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5E%7BJ%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%201%20%2B%20%5C%5Clog((%5C%5Csigma_j%5E%7B(i)%7D)%5E2)%20-%20(%5C%5Cmu_j%5E%7B(i)%7D)%5E2%20-%20(%5C%5Csigma_j%5E%7B(i)%7D)%5E2%20%5C%5Cright)%20%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BKL%20Divergence%20(Analytical)%7D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BL%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bl%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(i)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D)%20%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BReconstruction%20Likelihood%7D%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B8pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%5E%7B(i%2Cl)%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D%5E%7B(i)%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%5E%7B(i)%7D%20%5C%5Codot%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5E%7B(l)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5E%7B(l)%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7051410a9512cc2cd412a3beaf51b5b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22biuas%22%7D"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="Hyae6" id="Hyae6" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua525818e" id="ua525818e">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="ua7e771eb" id="ua7e771eb"> 𝑵𝒐𝒏𝒆𝒒𝒖𝒊𝒍𝒊𝒃𝒓𝒊𝒖𝒎 𝑻𝒉𝒆𝒓𝒎𝒐𝒅𝒚𝒏𝒂𝒎𝒊𝒄𝒔</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ue2e8d248" id="ue2e8d248"><strong><span data-lake-id="u82c45689" id="u82c45689">机器学习中的一个核心问题，是如何利用高度灵活的概率分布族对复杂数据集进行建模，同时仍使模型的学习、采样、推断与概率评估在解析上或计算上保持可处理性。从历史上看，概率模型长期面临灵活性与可处理性之间的权衡</span></strong></p><ul list="u2a7a3e8c"><li fid="ufb4f0dde" data-lake-id="u1555b1ac" id="u1555b1ac"><span data-lake-id="u3afe5707" id="u3afe5707">易于解析求值和拟合的模型通常难以充分刻画复杂数据中的丰富结构</span></li><li fid="ufb4f0dde" data-lake-id="u219d5fd9" id="u219d5fd9"><span data-lake-id="ub827fab4" id="ub827fab4">高度灵活的模型虽然能够适应任意复杂模式，却往往需要通过任意非负函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd2eda7422a84286bd20a497cb1d334a9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22plJlI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0b1d6a40" id="u0b1d6a40">定义分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cphi(x)%7D%7BZ%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff03e3e6f77b231a323ebdfc3f1351048.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MvONo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd67cac4" id="ubd67cac4">，其中归一化常数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fca9972fb0e732f9a939604a4b2e0f4c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pH83a%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8d50f9df" id="u8d50f9df">通常难以计算，从而使概率评估、训练与采样严重依赖代价高昂的蒙特卡洛方法</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udb9c5e3c" id="udb9c5e3c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8fa3ecd8" id="u8fa3ecd8">针对这一问题，论文提出一种兼顾模型灵活性与计算可处理性的生成建模方法</span></strong></p><ul list="ue11724b1"><li fid="ueeb6b2d9" data-lake-id="u90c694d4" id="u90c694d4"><span data-lake-id="u127bc05b" id="u127bc05b">核心思想来源于非平衡统计物理：首先通过迭代的前向扩散过程，有系统地、渐进地破坏数据分布中的结构；随后学习相应的反向扩散过程，以逐步恢复数据中的结构，从而构建出一种既具有高度表达能力、又具有良好可处理性的生成模型</span></li><li fid="ueeb6b2d9" data-lake-id="uc7983feb" id="uc7983feb"><span data-lake-id="uca6a7d15" id="uca6a7d15">该方法能够在具有数千层或数千个时间步的深层生成模型中高效完成模型学习、样本生成与概率评估，并进一步支持条件概率与后验概率的计算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1b972e5a" id="u1b972e5a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u45f82e15" id="u45f82e15">该方法建立在马尔可夫链框架之上，其核心思想源于非平衡统计物理与序列蒙特卡洛，即通过逐步的分布变换过程，实现从简单先验分布到复杂目标数据分布的生成建模</span></strong></p><ul list="ue49ccea8"><li fid="ubcc8d03f" data-lake-id="u2e50e217" id="u2e50e217"><span data-lake-id="u788e23ee" id="u788e23ee">构造一个生成性的马尔可夫链，通过扩散过程，将一个简单且已知的分布（例如高斯分布）逐步变换为目标的数据分布</span></li><li fid="ubcc8d03f" data-lake-id="ud8c557cf" id="ud8c557cf"><span data-lake-id="ua6f8fd12" id="ua6f8fd12">不同于将该马尔可夫链仅作为近似计算某个既定模型的工具，而是直接将</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0bcf645f" id="u0bcf645f" style="color: #AD1A2B">马尔可夫链的终点分布定义为模型本身</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5e88a6bb" id="u5e88a6bb">。由于扩散链中的每一步转移概率都可以被解析计算，因此整个链的概率同样能够被解析评估</span></li><li fid="ubcc8d03f" data-lake-id="ud261def7" id="ud261def7"><span data-lake-id="u85394f0c" id="u85394f0c">学习过程可以被理解为：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="udf0a08e6" id="udf0a08e6" style="color: #AD1A2B">对扩散过程中的微小扰动进行估计。与其用单一的、不可解析归一化的势函数去直接描述完整分布，不如估计这些小的局部变化，这在计算上更加可行</span></strong></li><li fid="ubcc8d03f" data-lake-id="u164865f8" id="u164865f8"><span data-lake-id="ud3fa8d98" id="ud3fa8d98">由于对于任意平滑的目标分布都可以构造相应的扩散过程，因此该方法理论上能够刻画</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u91f206e3" id="u91f206e3">任意形式的数据分布</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="gxN0W" id="gxN0W" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u5a89c168" id="u5a89c168">🐐</span><span data-lake-id="u616aed50" id="u616aed50"> 𝑹𝒆𝒍𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒉𝒊𝒑 𝒕𝒐 𝑶𝒕𝒉𝒆𝒓 𝑾𝒐𝒓𝒌</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ue92f1363" id="ue92f1363"><span data-lake-id="ued6731f5" id="ued6731f5">Wake-sleep 算法首次提出这样一种思想：让推断模型与生成概率模型相互对抗、共同训练。Kingma 与 Welling（2013）等工作发展变分学习与推断算法，使得灵活的生成模型与潜变量后验分布能够直接相互配合并联合训练。</span><span data-lake-id="ub9ece4eb" id="ub9ece4eb">上述工作中的变分下界与本文训练目标中采用的目标函数的形式是相似的，但是本文的研究动机与模型形式均与这些方法不同。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc4f7bec5" id="uc4f7bec5">相较于这些变分推断技术，论文方法具有以下差异与优势</span></strong></p><ul list="ud3fd8883"><li fid="u05e70385" data-lake-id="uafc709f0" id="uafc709f0"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf4e998d3" id="uf4e998d3">理论出发点不同：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2ade7694" id="u2ade7694">方法建立在物理学、准静态过程以及退火重要性采样等思想基础之上，而不是建立在变分贝叶斯框架之上 </span></li><li fid="u05e70385" data-lake-id="u95dd2fac" id="u95dd2fac"><strong><span data-lake-id="udd940559" id="udd940559">更易于与其他分布相结合：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue2719fc5" id="ue2719fc5">展示如何将学习到的分布与另一个概率分布方便地相乘，例如与条件分布结合以计算后验分布 </span></li><li fid="u05e70385" data-lake-id="u2718081e" id="u2718081e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u806c48f1" id="u806c48f1">缓解推断模型训练困难的问题：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u765f9b6e" id="u765f9b6e">在变分推断方法中，由于目标函数在推断模型与生成模型之间具有不对称性，推断模型的训练往往尤为困难。本文将前向过程（即推断过程）限制为一种简单的函数形式，从而使得反向过程（即生成过程）能够具有相同的函数形式 </span></li><li fid="u05e70385" data-lake-id="u52b7be9b" id="u52b7be9b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u44d9ae1e" id="u44d9ae1e">支持极深层的模型训练：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u468c140e" id="u468c140e">训练的是具有数千层或数千个时间步的模型，而不仅仅是具有少数层次的浅层结构</span></li><li fid="u05e70385" data-lake-id="ubb634fa0" id="ubb634fa0"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucac5be78" id="ucac5be78">提供热力学意义下的理论刻画：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7ad77069" id="u7ad77069">给出每一层或每一个时间步中熵产生的上界与下界</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf08d4e41" id="uf08d4e41"><strong><span data-lake-id="udabd5f4a" id="udabd5f4a">与物理学相关的理论联系</span></strong></p><ul list="uad68e228"><li fid="u6eae2ccf" data-lake-id="u9b1d6d9f" id="u9b1d6d9f"><span data-lake-id="ucc728d21" id="ucc728d21">与本文密切相关的思想包括 Jarzynski 等式，其在机器学习中被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf3f2e77c" id="uf3f2e77c">退火重要性采样</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u233cca13" id="u233cca13">（Annealed Importance Sampling, AIS）。AIS 利用一个马尔可夫链，缓慢地将一个分布转化为另一个分布，以计算两个分布归一化常数之比。Burda 等进一步指出，AIS 不仅可以沿前向轨迹实施，也可以沿反向轨迹进行</span></li><li fid="u6eae2ccf" data-lake-id="ub3d136ee" id="ub3d136ee"><span data-lake-id="u3fe69218" id="u3fe69218">Langevin 动力学作为 Fokker–Planck 方程的随机实现，说明如何构造一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u00713d6c" id="u00713d6c">高斯扩散过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6cc300b0" id="u6cc300b0">，使任意目标分布成为其平衡分布</span></li><li fid="u6eae2ccf" data-lake-id="u750d0c24" id="u750d0c24"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubd9fee70" id="ubd9fee70" style="color: #665800">Kolmogorov 前向方程与后向方程表明，前向扩散过程与反向扩散过程能够用相同的函数形式来描述</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub5657435" id="ub5657435">。其中，Kolmogorov 前向方程对应于 Fokker–Planck 方程，而 Kolmogorov 后向方程则描述这一扩散过程的时间反演形式，不过其成立需要已知密度函数关于时间演化的梯度信息</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="hFnzs" id="hFnzs" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub799e58f" id="ub799e58f">🐿️</span><span data-lake-id="u7e7e7362" id="u7e7e7362"> 𝑨𝒍𝒈𝒐𝒓𝒊𝒕𝒉𝒎</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ud4a72529" id="ud4a72529"><span data-lake-id="u1bb1faae" id="u1bb1faae">1️⃣</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8d78aa85" id="u8d78aa85"> 前向轨迹（Forward Trajectory）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufe676c2e" id="ufe676c2e">将数据分布记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc05581c3704265de4e43ac9606307dd5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VIBbu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud2cc719d" id="ud2cc719d">。通过反复施加关于分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi(y)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b1f9fa29dc931e0f770a7f2ae8e0674.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vW1ev%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud188607f" id="ud188607f">的马尔可夫扩散核</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T_%5C%5Cpi(y%5C%5Cmid%20y'%3B%5C%5Cbeta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff580a74b0ca313c3f348aba5cb786b6e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vJLt5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf6b3fd1a" id="uf6b3fd1a">，可将数据分布逐步转化为一个良态的（即可解析处理的）分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi(y)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b1f9fa29dc931e0f770a7f2ae8e0674.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fqodD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u717cacfa" id="u717cacfa">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6100158802e722a88c15efc101fc275b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QAfYT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1bf8467b" id="u1bf8467b">表示扩散速率。于是有</span></p><p data-lake-id="u335eb56b" id="u335eb56b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi(y)%3D%5C%5Cint%20dy'%20%5C%5C%2C%20T_%5C%5Cpi(y%5C%5Cmid%20y'%3B%5C%5Cbeta)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cpi(y')%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F576347f1901fa367ea26e6c045e65649.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ol3cn%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u527c8858"><li fid="u637f455c" data-lake-id="uec195bb1" id="uec195bb1"><span data-lake-id="uf9aaf4dc" id="uf9aaf4dc">并定义前向扩散过程的单步转移为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6b84aeea" id="u6b84aeea" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%3DT_%5C%5Cpi%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%3B%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cbigr)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F624fc63c55f7c7a03a4efc866ce94a68.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sAlx5%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2faefd12"><li fid="u021d93f5" data-lake-id="uabeb4def" id="uabeb4def"><span data-lake-id="uaa41e940" id="uaa41e940">因此，从数据分布出发并执行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V0Cwc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0f4f6142" id="u0f4f6142">步扩散所得到的前向轨迹可表示为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ucd591d6e" id="ucd591d6e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%3D%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3c1f35d5bb33255f978d50dddc16a048.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FM2l3%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u408a3b85" id="u408a3b85"><span data-lake-id="ucce00cd8" id="ucce00cd8">2️⃣</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u16f9f4cb" id="u16f9f4cb"> 反向轨迹（Reverse Trajectory）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u669ae28c" id="u669ae28c">生成模型分布将被训练为描述与前向轨迹相同、但方向相反的过程，即</span></p><p data-lake-id="u76525b01" id="u76525b01" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(T)%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cpi(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(T)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf9c6efacf37f1c7433a79fb449611ab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Fco6m%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue6b3f6b6" id="ue6b3f6b6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%3D%20p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(T)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ee884b30693a9632ef9eba5107beddc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l1wwU%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u25f42857"><li fid="u9ab35bf7" data-lake-id="u267c8cc9" id="u267c8cc9"><span data-lake-id="u40529278" id="u40529278">对于高斯扩散与二项扩散，在连续扩散情形下（即步长</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22loV8D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u71ee2d9d" id="u71ee2d9d">足够小时），扩散过程的反演在函数形式上与前向过程保持一致。也就是说，由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93a59595634786ba4970e1caf4759105.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MLLXp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua3aeb11e" id="ua3aeb11e">是高斯分布或二项分布，当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ASG66%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u922458d3" id="u922458d3">足够小时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F62727e2d5886bba051b460bb36822b63.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vUfbu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7f2f7646" id="u7f2f7646">也将分别保持为高斯分布或二项分布</span></li><li fid="u9ab35bf7" data-lake-id="u380eab95" id="u380eab95"><span data-lake-id="u7010bd51" id="u7010bd51">并且，轨迹越长，扩散速率就可以设定得越小。在学习过程中，仅需要估计以下参数：对于高斯扩散核，需要估计其均值与协方差；对于二项扩散核，则只需估计其比特翻转概率</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud89fc1a6" id="ud89fc1a6"><span data-lake-id="ucd45d76d" id="ucd45d76d">3️⃣</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc7de11ea" id="uc7de11ea"> 模型概率（Model Probability）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub62c565c" id="ub62c565c">生成模型赋予数据的概率可表示为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3f260704" id="u3f260704" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%3D%5C%5Cint%20dx%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5C%2C%20p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cbigr).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8df0ab5e844fcb7a3199ce664e9fb2fa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HURYr%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u04baf807"><li fid="uf54ffb5f" data-lake-id="ua973b5fb" id="ua973b5fb"><span data-lake-id="u05827013" id="u05827013">若直接计算该积分，通常是不可处理的。为此论文借鉴退火重要性采样以及 Jarzynski 等式的思想，不直接求解这一积分，而是转而考察前向轨迹与反向轨迹的相对概率，并对前向轨迹进行平均。于是有</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u25e56361" id="u25e56361" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cnp(x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20dx%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%20p(x%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bq(x%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%7D%7Bq(x%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B8pt%5D%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20dx%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%20q(x%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp(x%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D)%7D%7Bq(x%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B8pt%5D%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20dx%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%20q(x%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp(x%5E%7B(T)%7D)%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20p(x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%7D%7Bq(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4b2a2071c7fe27188244aa5110be99bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zIpkT%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u07004741"><li fid="ud1129d3a" data-lake-id="u227621b2" id="u227621b2"><span data-lake-id="u6af15c9b" id="u6af15c9b">这一表达式可以通过对前向轨迹分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbbd025cacdf2cef306aa3d187ac09e44.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ucHUT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u18526570" id="u18526570">进行采样并取平均，从而高效地估计。当扩散步长</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q6Yoa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua9f20a71" id="ua9f20a71">趋于无穷小时，前向轨迹分布与反向轨迹分布可以被构造得彼此一致。如果两者完全相同，那么只需要从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbbd025cacdf2cef306aa3d187ac09e44.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vtoTL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf4232fa4" id="uf4232fa4">中抽取</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc1dbd132" id="uc1dbd132">一个样本</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubd998e97" id="ubd998e97">，就能够精确计算上述积分。该情形对应于统计物理中的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u31ff546e" id="u31ff546e">准静态过程</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0b37545e" id="u0b37545e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Chat%7Bp%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BK%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bk%3D1%7D%5EK%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(x_k%5E%7B(T)%7D)%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_k%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_k%5E%7B(t)%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20q(x_k%5E%7B(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_k%5E%7B(t-1)%7D)%7D%20%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BImportance%20Weight%20%7D%20w_k%7D%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48020078797e886cc727a4f9afcebfcc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r989B%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uc680e405" id="uc680e405"><span data-lake-id="u21a1485d" id="u21a1485d">4️⃣</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u859cf30b" id="u859cf30b"> 训练（Training）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5e275938" id="u5e275938">模型训练的目标是最大化模型的对数似然</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0fcf5e9d" id="u0fcf5e9d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%3D%5C%5Cint%20dx%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5C%2C%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%5C%5Clog%20p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cbigr).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9b806876b36ce3e5524f39ba9af93f59.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RpKs9%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u05234377" id="u05234377" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%20%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20dx%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5C%2C%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cint%20dx%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%20%5C%5C%2C%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%20p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(T)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%7D%7B%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3c97090f6c5678e54ce7d47a50933ced.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TLx0w%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u929d0738"><li fid="u77d0a516" data-lake-id="u997c3459" id="u997c3459"><span data-lake-id="u1956ad5c" id="u1956ad5c">根据 Jensen 不等式，上式可得到如下下界：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf928b6b7" id="uf928b6b7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%20%5C%5Cge%20%5C%5Cint%20dx%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5C%2C%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(T)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%20p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%7D%7B%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48078e34428fa64c30326931410b6bf8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cKyZD%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud9771d49"><li fid="ud2f2601a" data-lake-id="ube822f9f" id="ube822f9f"><span data-lake-id="u7a45dff5" id="u7a45dff5">对于论文所采用的扩散轨迹，该下界可以进一步化简为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%20%5C%5Cge%20K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcdeb3513cbc83426b573bf55fc5df6c2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ncszq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u46e6556e" id="u46e6556e">， 熵项与 KL 散度项都可以解析计算。该下界的推导方式，与变分贝叶斯方法中对数似然下界的推导是平行的</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uadcf66ac" id="uadcf66ac" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5CnK%20%26%3D%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Cint%20d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%20d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%20q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cqquad%20D_%7BKL%7D%5C%5Cleft(%20q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2C%20p%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%20%2B%20H_q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(T)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20-%20H_q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20-%20H_p%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(T)%7D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb75822ff1dc98c8f8368a0099fbdd0c8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XnIpK%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue65a69bc"><li fid="udb3a1b3e" data-lake-id="u0e1fc643" id="u0e1fc643"><span data-lake-id="u14df309e" id="u14df309e">训练过程可以表述为：寻找一组反向马尔可夫转移，使得该对数似然下界最大。对复杂概率分布的估计问题，被转化为对一组函数的回归问题：在高斯扩散情形下，需要学习确定一系列高斯分布均值与协方差的函数；在 Bernoulli 试验情形下，则需要学习确定状态翻转概率的函数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub6704de1" id="ub6704de1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%20p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%3D%20%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmax_%7Bp(x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%7D%20K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe216caa2b99cbff84df1944bb8c3c41c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d9OwX%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf10bae4f" id="uf10bae4f"><span data-lake-id="u98df6389" id="u98df6389">5️⃣</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u06cb919a" id="u06cb919a"> 扩散速率</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HzeQL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0dc6e663" id="u0dc6e663">的设定：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf74bfc50" id="uf74bfc50">在前向轨迹中，扩散速率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WsBK3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8f63b462" id="u8f63b462">的选取对训练模型的性能具有重要影响。在 AIS 中，中间分布调度方式的选择会显著影响对对数配分函数的估计精度；在热力学中，从一个平衡分布过渡到另一个平衡分布所采用的调度方式，则决定自由能损失的大小</span></p><ul list="u40ea64b6"><li fid="u0fbfb7d0" data-lake-id="u846fb138" id="u846fb138"><span data-lake-id="u6f2a88f9" id="u6f2a88f9">对于</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u92451ac4" id="u92451ac4">高斯扩散</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u51a4611e" id="u51a4611e">，通过对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BHzYf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uafba4eca" id="uafba4eca">进行梯度上升来学习前向扩散调度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_2%2C%5C%5Cdots%2C%5C%5Cbeta_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3fa98bcfe94528d542c3400dbeecf0d3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22blahb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u247df00f" id="u247df00f">。其中，第一步的方差</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18d21d6e50fea8f85b241bfeab7de4c7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JGRTz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8ef005f7" id="u8ef005f7">被固定为一个较小常数，以避免过拟合。为显式表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a4791765de4cd6be7afe43c6055a622.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M9UpW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7e593c30" id="u7e593c30">对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_1%2C%5C%5Cdots%2C%5C%5Cbeta_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F71e5d7404150e56308561de59f6949b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HIXJG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u05e01653" id="u05e01653">的依赖关系，作者采用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7dbc145a" id="u7dbc145a">冻结噪声</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u49e954a4" id="u49e954a4">技巧，将噪声视为额外的辅助变量，并在计算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qVjs0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u90bdfcba" id="u90bdfcba">对参数的偏导数时保持该噪声固定</span></li><li fid="u0fbfb7d0" data-lake-id="ub96cded4" id="ub96cded4"><span data-lake-id="ue87712b3" id="ue87712b3">对于</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u23eb63e8" id="u23eb63e8">二项扩散</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1608642e" id="u1608642e">，由于离散状态空间的存在，无法像连续情形那样利用冻结噪声进行梯度上升。令前向扩散调度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_1%2C%5C%5Cdots%2C%5C%5Cbeta_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F71e5d7404150e56308561de59f6949b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xh1wk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u51d3ee81" id="u51d3ee81">满足在每一步扩散中都擦除原始信号的一个固定比例</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BT%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3c1f1e2325c5aaf79d8af96d6823e5de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YRJjv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9e82d058" id="u9e82d058">，从而得到扩散速率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%3D(T-t%2B1)%5E%7B-1%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F13e6f55ff836012d46c4def4be15903e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22meI1L%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub2419fc5" id="ub2419fc5"><span data-lake-id="uf6508b57" id="uf6508b57">6️⃣</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f9aaf34" id="u7f9aaf34"> 反向过程的熵（Entropy of Reverse Process）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u31a8c08d" id="u31a8c08d">由于前向过程是已知的，因此可以对反向轨迹中每一步的熵给出上界与下界。这些熵界可以进一步用于约束所学习得到的反向转移分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f431b2e1b377e5a939cca5966055be4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MKXJh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud95b854c" id="ud95b854c">。具体而言，反向轨迹中某一步条件熵满足如下不等式</span></p><p data-lake-id="u32a011de" id="u32a011de" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%26H_q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20H_q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20-%20H_q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cle%20H_q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cle%20H_q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf0298e96fc4c4d550570d4aa16d3467.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gBhkv%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="TlZMZ" id="TlZMZ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uc3ede8a1" id="uc3ede8a1">🐃</span><span data-lake-id="ue510069d" id="ue510069d"> 𝑴𝒖𝒍𝒕𝒊𝒑𝒍𝒚𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑫𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒓𝒊𝒃𝒖𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏𝒔, 𝒂𝒏𝒅 𝑪𝒐𝒎𝒑𝒖𝒕𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑷𝒐𝒔𝒕𝒆𝒓𝒊𝒐𝒓𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u6b542318" id="u6b542318"><span data-lake-id="uf050ab65" id="uf050ab65">在信号去噪或缺失值推断等任务中，通常需要计算后验分布，这要求将模型分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc25e28094a27d45f8d1e9ca6e546cee1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QeXtx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue3f5ad97" id="ue3f5ad97">与另一个分布或有界正函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2be98481e937ead490c9b75ba3da6f41.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uBkLJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc760cf51" id="uc760cf51">相乘，从而得到一个新的分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20p(x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%20%5C%5Cpropto%20p(x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%5C%5C%2C%20r(x%5E%7B(0)%7D).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F12bf87e9b3158da58ba0bad33ec96de5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DK27m%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0574aaa5" id="u0574aaa5">对于许多生成建模方法而言，分布相乘通常既困难又代价高昂。然而，在扩散模型框架下，这一操作却相对直接：第二个分布既可以被视为扩散过程中每一步的一个小扰动，也可以在许多情况下被精确地乘入每一步扩散过程之中</span></p><p data-lake-id="u516945aa" id="u516945aa"><strong><span data-lake-id="u29739288" id="u29739288">首先计算</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20p(x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F279bf66b0947a72938804a8a83fe1a2d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gzbuv%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u83d7ee94" id="u83d7ee94">，将每一个中间分布都乘上一个对应的函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F342074556e420a28504db4bb406a255d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UKyz4%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5231d102" id="u5231d102">。修正后的前向轨迹记</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20q(x%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1108341f7224018b938733797182de33.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CrBYG%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua802aa08" id="ua802aa08">。该轨迹从如下起始分布出发</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc7db0bdf" id="uc7db0bdf" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20q(x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Ctilde%20Z_0%7Dq(x%5E%7B(0)%7D)r(x%5E%7B(0)%7D)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F43a191598ae1bfab544a03cd08ad54b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eChto%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub3a90923"><li fid="u74b8cc83" data-lake-id="u3acc21e9" id="u3acc21e9"><span data-lake-id="u3fe1b9b0" id="u3fe1b9b0">并依次经过如下中间分布，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20Z_t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff56b08e34f1ab3419f6c403541547000.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZRmS5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u79788ac2" id="u79788ac2">是第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uYmIm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u540139c5" id="u540139c5">个中间分布的归一化常数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udae603e4" id="udae603e4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Ctilde%20Z_t%7Dq%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)r%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fef9415f3b3245334d344280ff5bf77b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uQBq5%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u0958bf54" id="u0958bf54"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5be2e599" id="u5be2e599">接下来，通过写出前向条件分布与反向条件分布之间的关系，可以看出：将每一个中间分布乘以</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F342074556e420a28504db4bb406a255d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rfrwj%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u69f306c2" id="u69f306c2">会如何改变原有的马尔可夫扩散链。根据 Bayes 定理，前向链满足</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc81636a9" id="uc81636a9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%5C%5C%2C%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%3D%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%5C%5C%2C%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F847e77672f7542a6f65afe8e44469d37.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WXzrB%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua3f92b52"><li fid="uc797391e" data-lake-id="uc038f24d" id="uc038f24d"><span data-lake-id="u05331358" id="u05331358">修正后的链则应满足</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u234d43c5" id="u234d43c5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Ctilde%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctilde%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Ctilde%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D%5C%5Cbigr).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f143b16f50f2ddb29247ef24f5b5faf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y7egs%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud1ebc030"><li fid="ub012abd9" data-lake-id="uca0e4b8e" id="uca0e4b8e"><span data-lake-id="u8651d462" id="u8651d462">一种可行的方式是将新的马尔可夫链定义为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u941b39d9" id="u941b39d9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Ctilde%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cpropto%20q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20r%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B6pt%5D%5Cn%26%5C%5Ctilde%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cpropto%20q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20r%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F06cfbf636971dd8033d972fc58d97d34.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yI9s9%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u807f3fb8"><li fid="u69c6cb9a" data-lake-id="ucb5813c1" id="ucb5813c1"><span data-lake-id="u29e91592" id="u29e91592">因此，为使</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20p(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb4d3189065a0ab9b380e1d26095dbdff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XeCPk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue3499ebc" id="ue3499ebc">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ctilde%20q(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcee43fdae633a4307b62b60d0fd0d9c4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nzh7M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf4345f3b" id="uf4345f3b">对应，原有的反向转移</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F189b1c08dffaf92f46535d4393bafbb6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HDtdr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue30ad67a" id="ue30ad67a">也应进行相应修正，即</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf4939aa1" id="uf4939aa1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%5C%5Cpropto%20p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%5C%5C%2C%20r%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b4a5a269bb58f684ecd32077ee181e1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w3WNy%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uee725912" id="uee725912"><strong><span data-lake-id="uce35e833" id="uce35e833">扩散模型可通过在各时间步逐步引入修正函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F342074556e420a28504db4bb406a255d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Uu9Or%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc7f266cc" id="uc7f266cc">，以平滑且可计算的方式实现分布相乘和后验推断</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u11ef724e" id="u11ef724e">  </span></p><ul list="ub1ad2ae2"><li fid="u6ff6b80f" data-lake-id="ub803afc6" id="ub803afc6"><span data-lake-id="u388c58da" id="u388c58da">如果</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F342074556e420a28504db4bb406a255d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CS86F%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5250b5c9" id="u5250b5c9">足够平滑，那么它可以被看作对反向扩散核</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F189b1c08dffaf92f46535d4393bafbb6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NlfEi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u108944f5" id="u108944f5">的一个小扰动。在这种情况下，修正后的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20p(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb4d3189065a0ab9b380e1d26095dbdff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PcNds%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3573cab3" id="u3573cab3">与原始的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F189b1c08dffaf92f46535d4393bafbb6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sze2Q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua8925338" id="ua8925338">具有相同的函数形式，但其参数会发生微小变化：对于高斯核而言，变化体现在均值和协方差上；对于二项核而言，则体现在状态翻转概率上</span></li><li fid="u6ff6b80f" data-lake-id="ucfaa7138" id="ucfaa7138"><span data-lake-id="u0dd1ce6b" id="u0dd1ce6b">如果</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F342074556e420a28504db4bb406a255d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Eiep1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue1e908e7" id="ue1e908e7">能够与高斯分布（或二项分布）进行闭式相乘，那么它就可以直接以闭式形式乘入反向扩散核</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t%2B1)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F189b1c08dffaf92f46535d4393bafbb6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wzBjV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u550ebb07" id="u550ebb07">，而无需再被视为一个微扰项。这种情形适用于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F342074556e420a28504db4bb406a255d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D3L9u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd2aa470" id="ubd2aa470">由某些坐标上的 delta 函数组成的情况</span></li><li fid="u6ff6b80f" data-lake-id="ub6c5b5f9" id="ub6c5b5f9"><span data-lake-id="u7ed8424f" id="u7ed8424f">通常</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F342074556e420a28504db4bb406a255d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TZGFF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uad94d681" id="uad94d681">应被设计为在整个轨迹过程中缓慢变化。作者采用最简单的设定，即令其保持常数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%3Dr%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cbigr).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fab8ad7c69a6b3fb5b05e03ebd32fbea5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iOKau%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua7eb61b1" id="ua7eb61b1">另一种方便的选择是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%3Dr%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7BT-t%7D%7BT%7D%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1e2111dd35d9711a9049a660c79300f5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uMFZ2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucf26855a" id="ucf26855a">在第二种设定下，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F342074556e420a28504db4bb406a255d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iOcwe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5288364e" id="u5288364e">在反向轨迹的起始分布中不产生贡献。这就保证从修正后的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%20p(x%5E%7B(T)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F75d59a2249f2cf203c5b8e58935a978d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dahh8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0b632c60" id="u0b632c60">中抽取反向轨迹初始样本时，仍然是简单且直接的</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="fNvjt" id="fNvjt" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u2ca0dbb8" id="u2ca0dbb8">🦄</span><span data-lake-id="u06b9340e" id="u06b9340e"> 𝑳𝒐𝒈 𝑳𝒊𝒌𝒆𝒍𝒊𝒉𝒐𝒐𝒅 𝑳𝒐𝒘𝒆𝒓 𝑩𝒐𝒖𝒏𝒅  </span></h2><p data-lake-id="ubf161994" id="ubf161994"><span data-lake-id="ufd1b4577" id="ufd1b4577">1️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u0f9aee98" id="u0f9aee98"> 作者首先将模型的训练目标表示为关于整条前向轨迹分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa3113b9add5cba54c124e5cde30f5b57.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kJM5t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc07b0934" id="uc07b0934">的期望形式，并在此基础上推导一个可优化的对数似然下界</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc92e25c6" id="uc92e25c6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20L%20%5C%5Cge%20K%20%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%20q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20p%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(T)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%7Bq%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F700a1fa6bcbe350de261c1433d6fe82a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RG7dt%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6d33cea5" id="u6d33cea5"><span data-lake-id="u2932c863" id="u2932c863">2️⃣</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(X%5E%7B(T)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cfb21dfb59cc068c8610690c95ae06.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qJKa2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaf929513" id="uaf929513">的熵项。首先，可以将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(X%5E%7B(T)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cfb21dfb59cc068c8610690c95ae06.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wqujv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4feb6b5b" id="u4feb6b5b">的贡献单独拆分出来，并将其改写为一个熵项</span></p><p data-lake-id="u94c4504a" id="u94c4504a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20dx%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5C%2Cq%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Clog%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%7D%20%7Bq%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cint%20dx%5E%7B(T)%7D%5C%5C%2Cq%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(T)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%5C%5Clog%20p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(T)%7D%5C%5Cbigr).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F571a4a6f940f2737897c2c0b01687434.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LY4gz%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ude30d482"><li fid="u0b5ec566" data-lake-id="u9bb7900b" id="u9bb7900b"><span data-lake-id="u9c7996b6" id="u9c7996b6">又由于在本文构造的扩散核下，分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54adfbdb3548cf3b09d4fedcb506df22.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yaiG0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5c70ebe4" id="u5c70ebe4">相对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi(x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1880bec9c8a4cc60b38d3f501be80d7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rsfNA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a47ba5b" id="u9a47ba5b">的交叉熵在所有时间步上都保持为常数，并且该常数恰好等于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(X%5E%7B(T)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde4b164cfdd7319d5a5e9d5d0e1475c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m2GT5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u984e7290" id="u984e7290">的熵，因此有</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u29d955db" id="u29d955db" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B-%5C%5Cint%20dx%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5C%2C%20q(x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi(x%5E%7B(t)%7D)%20%3D%20H_p(X%5E%7B(T)%7D)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa3424743ad96fb45584ddd6d33751178.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cH9da%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6aa1f22a" id="u6aa1f22a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Cint%20dx%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5C%2Cq%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%5C%5Clog%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%7D%20%7Bq%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20-%20H_p%5C%5Cbigl(X%5E%7B(T)%7D%5C%5Cbigr).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb015fd11eda4bd270ad6ab5a30c4c9e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22epHFt%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u550b3128" id="u550b3128"><span data-lake-id="u9fe84f28" id="u9fe84f28">3️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u06e5f26c" id="u06e5f26c"> 消除</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf76c4580adc6af67436e1cd68eed17d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Uhstl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04a1e5c7" id="u04a1e5c7">处的边界效应，作者将反向轨迹的最后一步直接设定为与对应的前向扩散步骤相同，即</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9cdabe4e" id="u9cdabe4e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(1)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%3D%20q%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(1)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(1)%7D%5C%5Cbigr)%7D%20%3D%20T_%5C%5Cpi%5C%5Cbigl(x%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(1)%7D%3B%5C%5Cbeta_1%5C%5Cbigr).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3b463c3e1dfe4fdb4c00875e2b5a89a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TEUiK%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u16ee02ea"><li fid="u1f6b3440" data-lake-id="u59fffb35" id="u59fffb35"><span data-lake-id="u08a3c2c5" id="u08a3c2c5">在这一设定下，和式中第一步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe85963025272e26b55faee81091bcf89.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e8Wbb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u62457a86" id="u62457a86">的贡献可以被消去，从而得到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8f607450" id="u8f607450" s