f"><span data-lake-id="ua26b92c6" id="ua26b92c6">4️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u418dd886" id="u418dd886"> 改写为关于后验</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E%7B(t)%7D%2Cx%5E%7B(0)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9faa8d7e1dcd2dbf94c669d565207c24.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BJAGd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8d7e1a09" id="u8d7e1a09">的形式。由于前向轨迹是一个马尔可夫过程，因此上式可以改写为</span></p><p data-lake-id="udc3df97f" id="udc3df97f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Cint%20d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%20q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%7Bq%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20-%20H_p%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(T)%7D%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F629f73f5ed57d13c86fdf54d9bac410f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NQq5r%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u944eb94c"><li fid="u467f4039" data-lake-id="ub3c02b74" id="ub3c02b74"><span data-lake-id="u18e5e141" id="u18e5e141">进一步利用 Bayes 定理，可将其改写为关于前向轨迹后验与边缘分布的形式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub061cd0d" id="ub061cd0d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Cint%20d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%20q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%7Bq%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bq%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%7Bq%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20-%20H_p%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(T)%7D%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9ee88c96c881984255ec3cccd44b058e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VlpNW%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u330c8a60" id="u330c8a60"><span data-lake-id="u7b2c979c" id="u7b2c979c">5️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="uadf4165f" id="uadf4165f"> 改写为 KL 散度与熵项。由条件熵项的望远镜求和，可进一步化简为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u54d463db" id="u54d463db" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Balign*%7D%5CnK%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Cint%20d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%20q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%7Bq%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%2B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20H_q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20-%20H_q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20-%20H_p%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(T)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B6pt%5D%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Cint%20d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%20q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0%5C%5Ccdots%20T)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%7Bq%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%2B%20H_q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(T)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20-%20H_q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20-%20H_p%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(T)%7D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Balign*%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdb6e729abee44d0577d21e2d8cecd80c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ufV58%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1d19e26f"><li fid="u2ec3ee5f" data-lake-id="u4776c0ea" id="u4776c0ea"><span data-lake-id="u1469948a" id="u1469948a">最后将对数概率比改写为 KL 散度，即得到正文中的最终形式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub2ac32aa" id="ub2ac32aa" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Balign*%7D%5CnK%20%26%3D%20-%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Cint%20d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%20d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%20q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20D_%7BKL%7D%5C%5Cleft(q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%20p%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%20%2B%20H_q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(T)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20-%20H_q%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20-%20H_p%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B(T)%7D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Balign*%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0084989d9032f18b1930ea79b9b27d3c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hfRe2%22%7D"></card></p>